OL,3,ATrial over killing of Australian surfer
OL,4,Abrothers and US friend starts in Mexico
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have gone on trial in Mexico
OL,7,Ffor the alleged murders of two
OL,8,FAustralian brothers and their American
OL,9,Ffriend in 2024.
OL,11,FThe bodies of Callum Robinson, his
OL,12,Fyounger brother Jake, and their friend
OL,13,FCarter Rhoad from California - all in
OL,14,Ftheir early 30s - were found at the
OL,15,Fbottom of a well with gunshot wounds to
OL,16,Ftheir heads, days after they went
OL,17,Fmissing during a surf trip in Baja
OL,18,FCalifornia.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
