OL,3,ATrial over killing of Australian surfer
OL,4,Abrothers and US friend starts in Mexico
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors are seeking jail sentences
OL,7,Fof more than 200 years for the
OL,8,Fdefendants, who also face charges of
OL,9,Fviolent robbery and auto theft.
OL,11,FThe parents of the brothers were in
OL,12,Fcourt on Tuesday in the coastal town of
OL,13,FEnsenada, telling the media that it was
OL,14,F"incredibly important and
OL,15,Foverwhelmingly difficult".
